        }
      ],
      "description": "Bytes received/sent on public Ingress connections after TLS, including HTTP headers/framing and upgraded streams. Selected-range sampled counter increase, displayed as B/KiB/MiB/GiB. Ingress and Relay measure different hops; do not add them together. TLS records and IP/link overhead are excluded. Counter resets are handled per producer before summation.",
